        "turn_id": "01a03f9b-da82-7a93-b8c7-6974cc7f563d",
        "message_id": "msg_09747b8db7972cfa016a8f5b7cb43887d19b351f7f6ca3612e",
        "role": "assistant",
        "phase": "final_answer",
        "text_utf8": "A program, not another agent.\n\nThe PuppetMaster host/controller would:\n\n1. Read the bounded task’s raw assistant outputs.\n2. Extract every `PM_RESULT` candidate.\n3. Strictly parse and schema-validate them.\n4. Require all valid candidates to represent the same typed value.\n5. Reject missing, malformed, or conflicting results.\n6. Emit one canonical minified JSON result.\n\nNo model call or judgment is involved. For qualification, the program also compares that canonical result with the frozen oracle. This keeps normalization deterministic, cheap, and independent of harness-specific prose.",
