    "objective_utf8": "Course-correct and complete PuppetMaster's original bounded-context prompt-complexity project. Prove, using the already-completed Storage Plan as a sandboxed end-to-end pre-WorkNode vertical slice, that automated PuppetMaster workflows other than separate direct Assistant Chat can receive bounded task-specific PromptCapsules through the platform's native one-prompt Goal interfaces without giant prompts or custom Goal choreography, while preserving authority, safety, lineage, and deterministic host validation. Preserve canonical Plans and ledgers unchanged and create no WorkNodes. The host must be deterministic program code, not another agent: from the bounded verified assistant text it must extract every line-shaped PM_RESULT candidate, strictly parse and schema/type/value/order validate each without repair or coercion, require at least one, permit only canonically identical duplicates, reject malformed or conflicting candidates, and emit one canonical minified typed result; harness-specific surrounding prose is non-authoritative. Native Goal activation and successful completion, zero forbidden ordinary tools/retries, current route/config custody, and normal exit remain independent mandatory gates. First qualify exactly one fresh zero-credit normalized native OMP Goal canary with opencode-zen/mimo-v2.5-free at high. If that passes, freeze and empirically qualify the authorized 12-route matrix twice on unchanged bytes/configuration, with MiMo/high replacing the delisted opencode-go/ox-alpha-free|max rows and every other prescribed route/order preserved: MiMo first, Cursor/default auto second, Qwen last. Use native OMP /goal with both advisor controls off for OMP routes and native Codex App Goal with one ordinary prompt beginning 'Create a goal that' for Codex routes. Require unique fresh identities, exact typed normalized output, raw native Goal lifecycle evidence, deterministic host verification, no WorkNodes, no retro-credit, and preservation of every failure. Fresh development diagnostics may use additional OMP calls, but consumed qualification rows are never retried or retro-credited. Do not spend paid, Codex, or Cursor tokens until the free first-route harness passes cleanly. If MiMo Free becomes unavailable, preserve the failure and pivot through a freshly frozen authorized cheap fallback using Muse or opencode-go/glm-5.3-flash at xhigh rather than stopping or weakening acceptance. Use gpt-5.6-sol medium and xhigh subagents for the bulk of implementation and adversarial review. Every 30 minutes, re-read this objective and audit for drift, looping, or churn; if detected, simplify, pivot, or reset architecture and keep progressing rather than stopping.",
